(6442465, 956754, 121949, '<td valign="top">I love the cool tones of this photo that said I wonder if a summer photo would do better with warm tones, never the less, one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I love the cool tones of this photo that said I wonder if a summer photo would do better with warm tones, never the less, one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2011-06-13 01:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442469, 956738, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely! One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'This is just lovely! One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2011-06-13 01:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442473, 956702, 117534, '<td valign="top">What a cool old place! Looks like something out of Mayberry! Nice job with the processing! Makes me want to go to Chalkville</td>', 'What a cool old place! Looks like something out of Mayberry! Nice job with the processing! Makes me want to go to Chalkville', '2011-06-13 01:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442482, 956659, 121949, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot, the soft processing is just beautiful. I only wish there was a bit more perspective to tell me why this is a July photo, the bold red almost says christmas to me. At anyrate a great shot and a 7 from me.</td>', 'I really love this shot, the soft processing is just beautiful. I only wish there was a bit more perspective to tell me why this is a July photo, the bold red almost says christmas to me. At anyrate a great shot and a 7 from me.', '2011-06-13 01:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442486, 955998, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I really love how the leaves fill up the frame. My only complaint is the soft focus, I would love to see this nice and crisp.</td>', 'This is a great shot, I really love how the leaves fill up the frame. My only complaint is the soft focus, I would love to see this nice and crisp.', '2011-06-13 01:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442491, 956565, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful long exposure, I wish we could see the horizon and then I would really be in love with it. Still a great shot and worthy of a 7 in my book.</td>', 'This is a wonderful long exposure, I wish we could see the horizon and then I would really be in love with it. Still a great shot and worthy of a 7 in my book.', '2011-06-13 01:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442495, 956628, 121949, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! I imagine this was quite difficult to time! You have done an excellent job. My only small critique is it is slightly over processed for my taste</td>', 'What a fun shot! I imagine this was quite difficult to time! You have done an excellent job. My only small critique is it is slightly over processed for my taste', '2011-06-13 01:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442529, 956202, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would have cloned out the sticks in the water to make the image "cleaner". DPC like things clean, so I would imagine your score will suffer a bit. Seems silly on such a nice image, but true.</td>', 'I would have cloned out the sticks in the water to make the image "cleaner". DPC like things clean, so I would imagine your score will suffer a bit. Seems silly on such a nice image, but true.', '2011-06-13 02:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442533, 956738, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely  So warm and golden.  Love the backlighting.  Dreamlike</td>', 'This is just lovely  So warm and golden.  Love the backlighting.  Dreamlike', '2011-06-13 02:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442535, 956755, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is darling.  It has such a feeling of nostalgia.  Loving the tilt and those catchlights.</td>', 'This is darling.  It has such a feeling of nostalgia.  Loving the tilt and those catchlights.', '2011-06-13 02:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442536, 956756, 50864, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful. will back to look again.</td>', 'wow, beautiful. will back to look again.', '2011-06-13 02:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442537, 956632, 60173, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was going to be boring with the out of focus leaves on the left side, but as I switched to the next image I caught a glance at the blueberries. Those are gorgeous! <br/> <br/>I don''t know if a different crop would help with this composition or not. As it is, even though the leaves are not in focus they dominate nearly a whole half of the screen. Since I scan an image left to right my eyes got bored by the time they got to the blueberries and had already sent the signal to my brain to hit the next button.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this was going to be boring with the out of focus leaves on the left side, but as I switched to the next image I caught a glance at the blueberries. Those are gorgeous!  I don''t know if a different crop would help with this composition or not. As it is, even though the leaves are not in focus they dominate nearly a whole half of the screen. Since I scan an image left to right my eyes got bored by the time they got to the blueberries and had already sent the signal to my brain to hit the next button.', '2011-06-13 02:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442538, 955896, 60173, '<td valign="top">I almost wish that foreground flower weren''t there. That background is killer.</td>', 'I almost wish that foreground flower weren''t there. That background is killer.', '2011-06-13 02:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442540, 956585, 60173, '<td valign="top">Yes, that is exactly how you''re supposed to use that lens! Awesome...</td>', 'Yes, that is exactly how you''re supposed to use that lens! Awesome...', '2011-06-13 02:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442541, 956713, 60173, '<td valign="top">These big poppies are surprisingly difficult to get a good shot of. It''s really easy to blow the reds out and the DOF is tough. You''ve done a great job of controlling both of those aspects and chose a strong composition.</td>', 'These big poppies are surprisingly difficult to get a good shot of. It''s really easy to blow the reds out and the DOF is tough. You''ve done a great job of controlling both of those aspects and chose a strong composition.', '2011-06-13 02:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442543, 956710, 60173, '<td valign="top">It''s fascinating how the bottom of the dress looks like a haunting flame of some sort. Almost as if a ghost of a woman who died in a a house fire.</td>', 'It''s fascinating how the bottom of the dress looks like a haunting flame of some sort. Almost as if a ghost of a woman who died in a a house fire.', '2011-06-13 02:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442571, 956738, 101668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. simply beautiful Colours mood everything.</td>', 'Beautiful. simply beautiful Colours mood everything.', '2011-06-13 03:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
