(6442670, 956630, 99263, '<td valign="top">Love the way the winter sun''s last rays bring out the golden colors of the grass and the remaining leaves in the trees. Lovely composition. Taken near Clarens, South Africa by any chance? :)</td>', 'Love the way the winter sun''s last rays bring out the golden colors of the grass and the remaining leaves in the trees. Lovely composition. Taken near Clarens, South Africa by any chance? :)', '2011-06-13 05:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
