(6442697, 956619, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow--that is definitely one crazy tree.  I really like the subject, but for me, the plants on the right side seem a little too bright, and they throw the image off-balance.</td>', 'Wow--that is definitely one crazy tree.  I really like the subject, but for me, the plants on the right side seem a little too bright, and they throw the image off-balance.', '2011-06-13 07:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
