(6442699, 956489, 128323, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this.  I think what''s going to keep this from scoring well are (1) the left side is way over-exposed, and (2) the crop doesn''t really seem like it would work for a calendar.</td>', 'I love shots like this.  I think what''s going to keep this from scoring well are (1) the left side is way over-exposed, and (2) the crop doesn''t really seem like it would work for a calendar.', '2011-06-13 07:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442700, 956683, 128323, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, and good choice of month!  The only thing I would have changed is to clone out the bright bits in the middle of the frame, right below the horizon.  Other than that, great shot!</td>', 'Nice silhouette, and good choice of month!  The only thing I would have changed is to clone out the bright bits in the middle of the frame, right below the horizon.  Other than that, great shot!', '2011-06-13 07:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
