(6446775, 956736, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you went for a tight shot. A faster shutter speed would''ve helped you achieved better lighting (so the side of the cat doesn''t wash out) as well as more sharpness. Also, I wouldn''t have cropped  off the tips of the ears. <br/>As an added note- I really like the cat''s expression. Very non-chalant.</td>', 'I like the fact that you went for a tight shot. A faster shutter speed would''ve helped you achieved better lighting (so the side of the cat doesn''t wash out) as well as more sharpness. Also, I wouldn''t have cropped  off the tips of the ears. As an added note- I really like the cat''s expression. Very non-chalant.', '2011-06-18 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
