(6447627, 955877, 96664, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors! I like the background too. Added a nice contrast to keep the eye on the flower you were trying to photograph. Few things on the flower that may have been able to be removed but those are sorta tiny so I don''t think that will be too much of a problem for voters.</td>', 'Very nice colors! I like the background too. Added a nice contrast to keep the eye on the flower you were trying to photograph. Few things on the flower that may have been able to be removed but those are sorta tiny so I don''t think that will be too much of a problem for voters.', '2011-06-19 21:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447628, 956063, 96664, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and I like the way the fog adds to the "dreamy" feel. Not sure if it is a tree or not but in the middle of the photo the dark spot is a bit distracting... (although you couldn''t take it out with advanced editing) may want to take it out and put it on your wall? Might add nicely to a room.</td>', 'Nice tones and I like the way the fog adds to the "dreamy" feel. Not sure if it is a tree or not but in the middle of the photo the dark spot is a bit distracting... (although you couldn''t take it out with advanced editing) may want to take it out and put it on your wall? Might add nicely to a room.', '2011-06-19 21:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447629, 956489, 96664, '<td valign="top">Like the right side... Don''t like the left. The crop works well with this type or photo. Maybe should have waited until sunset (or maybe you waited too long after sunrise).</td>', 'Like the right side... Don''t like the left. The crop works well with this type or photo. Maybe should have waited until sunset (or maybe you waited too long after sunrise).', '2011-06-19 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447630, 956101, 96664, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo overall but I think it lacks the "zing" that voters look for. What is the main subject? Could be many things in this image. Where did you want my eye to go?</td>', 'Very nice photo overall but I think it lacks the "zing" that voters look for. What is the main subject? Could be many things in this image. Where did you want my eye to go?', '2011-06-19 21:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447631, 956736, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Only thing I don''t like about it is the fact that the cat''s ears were chopped off. :(<br/>I do however like the clarity of the whiskers.</td>', 'I like this one. Only thing I don''t like about it is the fact that the cat''s ears were chopped off. :(I do however like the clarity of the whiskers.', '2011-06-19 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447632, 956479, 96664, '<td valign="top">Second golf ball image here. This seems too grainy. However has more in the photo to tell a story.</td>', 'Second golf ball image here. This seems too grainy. However has more in the photo to tell a story.', '2011-06-19 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447633, 956745, 96664, '<td valign="top">O_O<br/> <br/>I have always liked these types of photos. Might be a low quality camera or maybe you cropped a lot. It seems like a low resolution. Just my opinion though.</td>', 'O_O I have always liked these types of photos. Might be a low quality camera or maybe you cropped a lot. It seems like a low resolution. Just my opinion though.', '2011-06-19 21:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
