(6447637, 956312, 96664, '<td valign="top">I almost like this shot a lot... Two things holding me back though... <br/>1 - Head is chopped off at the top... <br/>2 - The right side of the background is a bit distracting. <br/>Other than those two faults I think this image tells a story. That statue is cool!</td>', 'I almost like this shot a lot... Two things holding me back though... 1 - Head is chopped off at the top... 2 - The right side of the background is a bit distracting. Other than those two faults I think this image tells a story. That statue is cool!', '2011-06-19 21:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447638, 956676, 96664, '<td valign="top">Top page is my guess this will end up. Stunning! I love the reflections!  Very clear and crisp. I read in a magazine once that an image like this where the main subject on the right is less appealing than if it were flipped and the main subject was on the right. Just a thought you can try out if you plan on going back to edit this a bit more.</td>', 'Top page is my guess this will end up. Stunning! I love the reflections!  Very clear and crisp. I read in a magazine once that an image like this where the main subject on the right is less appealing than if it were flipped and the main subject was on the right. Just a thought you can try out if you plan on going back to edit this a bit more.', '2011-06-19 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447639, 956683, 96664, '<td valign="top">Very sharp! I love the colors too! Top left though I sort of wish I had the whole plant in the image rather than it being cut off.</td>', 'Very sharp! I love the colors too! Top left though I sort of wish I had the whole plant in the image rather than it being cut off.', '2011-06-19 21:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
