(6447641, 956698, 96664, '<td valign="top">Cool bug! What is it? <br/>My opinion on how you might make this photo better is having the bug the main subject rather than the bug/flower as the main subject.</td>', 'Cool bug! What is it? My opinion on how you might make this photo better is having the bug the main subject rather than the bug/flower as the main subject.', '2011-06-19 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447642, 956202, 96664, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did it but the reflection looks better than the actual balloon. The actual balloon looks a little washed out of colors. Maybe too much editing? I think if you had as much color in the balloon as you did in the reflection it would be better. Still a good image overall though.</td>', 'Not sure how you did it but the reflection looks better than the actual balloon. The actual balloon looks a little washed out of colors. Maybe too much editing? I think if you had as much color in the balloon as you did in the reflection it would be better. Still a good image overall though.', '2011-06-19 21:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447643, 956386, 96664, '<td valign="top">Looks peaceful here. The trees almost look fake though. I think that is the only thing that (for me) is holding me back from REALLY liking this shot. Other than that though. I think I like it.</td>', 'Looks peaceful here. The trees almost look fake though. I think that is the only thing that (for me) is holding me back from REALLY liking this shot. Other than that though. I think I like it.', '2011-06-19 21:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447645, 956664, 96664, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion says that you may have needed a boost on that contrast bar. I think that would bring the ball to life more. Also, maybe add something to it. Like a flag or hole in the background or something. Just a thought for next time! :)</td>', 'Personal opinion says that you may have needed a boost on that contrast bar. I think that would bring the ball to life more. Also, maybe add something to it. Like a flag or hole in the background or something. Just a thought for next time! :)', '2011-06-19 21:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
