(6447672, 956539, 96664, '<td valign="top">Before I comment I am going to assume you have been having many comments about the editing. So I won''t say anything about it however what I will say is that I am sure this photo looked great right out the camera. Those are some great colors you got going there.</td>', 'Before I comment I am going to assume you have been having many comments about the editing. So I won''t say anything about it however what I will say is that I am sure this photo looked great right out the camera. Those are some great colors you got going there.', '2011-06-19 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447673, 956680, 96664, '<td valign="top">Aww yes... The squirrel... How could we have a challenge and not have this furry little creature present. Nice crisp shot. Nice bokeh in the background too.</td>', 'Aww yes... The squirrel... How could we have a challenge and not have this furry little creature present. Nice crisp shot. Nice bokeh in the background too.', '2011-06-19 21:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
