(6447675, 956659, 96664, '<td valign="top">Now isn''t little thing cute! Looks so soft! Not a cat person myself but this one is just too soft looking to pass up!</td>', 'Now isn''t little thing cute! Looks so soft! Not a cat person myself but this one is just too soft looking to pass up!', '2011-06-19 21:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
