(6447677, 956632, 96664, '<td valign="top">I like the water droplets on this but the left side is a bit distracting. Just my opinion. Berries look good though! Mmmm blueberry waffles! NOM NOM NOM!!!</td>', 'I like the water droplets on this but the left side is a bit distracting. Just my opinion. Berries look good though! Mmmm blueberry waffles! NOM NOM NOM!!!', '2011-06-19 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
