(6447682, 956575, 96664, '<td valign="top">Great colors! I would say the only thing here that is a bit distracting is the flash reflected in the eye. (I think this because the eye is right where my eye went).</td>', 'Great colors! I would say the only thing here that is a bit distracting is the flash reflected in the eye. (I think this because the eye is right where my eye went).', '2011-06-19 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
