(6447685, 956264, 96664, '<td valign="top">Mmm... Looks good! Photographically speaking I think this could use a misty spray and a darker background... But boy do those look good!</td>', 'Mmm... Looks good! Photographically speaking I think this could use a misty spray and a darker background... But boy do those look good!', '2011-06-19 21:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447689, 956648, 96664, '<td valign="top">I love the rain in this one. Black and white really works for this as well... How long did you have to wait for this pose he is giving you? First thought that came to my mind was "Watchyou-talkin-bout-Willis"<br/>Haha!</td>', 'I love the rain in this one. Black and white really works for this as well... How long did you have to wait for this pose he is giving you? First thought that came to my mind was "Watchyou-talkin-bout-Willis"Haha!', '2011-06-19 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447693, 956737, 96664, '<td valign="top">Paddle surfing is something I have always wanted to do. Just never had the time to nor the equipment. As for the image, the surfer looks good as a silhouette therefore I think that maybe you should have boosted up the contrast some To keep him completely dark. Just my opinion though.</td>', 'Paddle surfing is something I have always wanted to do. Just never had the time to nor the equipment. As for the image, the surfer looks good as a silhouette therefore I think that maybe you should have boosted up the contrast some To keep him completely dark. Just my opinion though.', '2011-06-19 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447698, 956675, 96664, '<td valign="top">Lovely catch here. Looks like a spot light on the flag and the bird. The tree added a nice background too. I almost wish the bird was closer to you though so that you could have the background as both the tree AND the flag. I think that would have looked awesome. But working with animals, you get what you get.</td>', 'Lovely catch here. Looks like a spot light on the flag and the bird. The tree added a nice background too. I almost wish the bird was closer to you though so that you could have the background as both the tree AND the flag. I think that would have looked awesome. But working with animals, you get what you get.', '2011-06-19 22:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447699, 956518, 96664, '<td valign="top">Geometrically speaking, I love the photo. The bridge being framed by the tree and sidewalk really makes the bridge pop! Only thing I have a small issue with is the people. Their red shirts really take away from the beauty of architect on the bridge.</td>', 'Geometrically speaking, I love the photo. The bridge being framed by the tree and sidewalk really makes the bridge pop! Only thing I have a small issue with is the people. Their red shirts really take away from the beauty of architect on the bridge.', '2011-06-19 22:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
