(6447711, 956618, 96664, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but too grainy for my liking. I like the fact that it is shard in the right areas (eye of the bug and blade of grass).</td>', 'Cool shot but too grainy for my liking. I like the fact that it is shard in the right areas (eye of the bug and blade of grass).', '2011-06-19 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447716, 956419, 96664, '<td valign="top">Looks like he needs a hair brush! Feathers are everywhere on this felluh! Haha! Cool photo! Nice bokeh in the background but kinda wish it was on both sides of the bird''s body.</td>', 'Looks like he needs a hair brush! Feathers are everywhere on this felluh! Haha! Cool photo! Nice bokeh in the background but kinda wish it was on both sides of the bird''s body.', '2011-06-19 22:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447718, 956635, 96664, '<td valign="top">Couple of things I see with this photo that if taken out would make for a top 5 photo (at least for me). The sidewalk/road and the move the camera a bit to the left. That gets rid of the branches coming into the frame and brings in the second tree that was cut off. Other than that the colors and sharpness are stunning. I wish I was there right now!</td>', 'Couple of things I see with this photo that if taken out would make for a top 5 photo (at least for me). The sidewalk/road and the move the camera a bit to the left. That gets rid of the branches coming into the frame and brings in the second tree that was cut off. Other than that the colors and sharpness are stunning. I wish I was there right now!', '2011-06-19 22:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6447720, 956636, 96664, '<td valign="top">Cool splash but I think without it covering his body and head would have made the photo better. Just my thought though.</td>', 'Cool splash but I think without it covering his body and head would have made the photo better. Just my thought though.', '2011-06-19 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
