(6447740, 956759, 96664, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I like that their legs are just kinda dangling there. Adds to an already cool photo. I like the background and how it contrasts the dark toads to bring them out more. Well done!</td>', 'This is cool. I like that their legs are just kinda dangling there. Adds to an already cool photo. I like the background and how it contrasts the dark toads to bring them out more. Well done!', '2011-06-19 22:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
