(6447744, 956699, 96664, '<td valign="top">Oh yes... The water droplet shot. Couldn''t resist could we? Haha! I like this one but getting a reflection (for me) is what these photos are all about. Lovely blue color though.</td>', 'Oh yes... The water droplet shot. Couldn''t resist could we? Haha! I like this one but getting a reflection (for me) is what these photos are all about. Lovely blue color though.', '2011-06-19 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
