(6447957, 955906, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very, very strange. I think the strangeness of it is highlighted by the central placement of the building and reflection, and by how the shed/tree balance out the clouds upper left. It''s like a strange, Boschian progression of heaven &amp; earth. Beautifully done!</td>', 'This is very, very strange. I think the strangeness of it is highlighted by the central placement of the building and reflection, and by how the shed/tree balance out the clouds upper left. It''s like a strange, Boschian progression of heaven & earth. Beautifully done!', '2011-06-20 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
