(6447962, 956749, 58634, '<td valign="top">This image is WAY underrated. I think you should''ve scored a lot better! When I first saw it, I thought it was just a person hiking, and once I actually paid attention I realized this was no ordinary person. <br/>I immediately thought of the indigenous people from my country- Ecuador, so I''m glad to see I was very close since this was taken in Peru. <br/>Gorgeous shot and great capture!</td>', 'This image is WAY underrated. I think you should''ve scored a lot better! When I first saw it, I thought it was just a person hiking, and once I actually paid attention I realized this was no ordinary person. I immediately thought of the indigenous people from my country- Ecuador, so I''m glad to see I was very close since this was taken in Peru. Gorgeous shot and great capture!', '2011-06-20 01:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
