(6448617, 956585, 96751, '<td valign="top">It is so very difficult to capture the awesomeness of nature, to be able to impart its grandeur in a small square of colors.  But that is what you have done here, Christophe.  Congrats on your ribbon.  It would be annoying that you''re always winning, except that you put so much effort into everything you do, that instead, it''s an inspiration.</td>', 'It is so very difficult to capture the awesomeness of nature, to be able to impart its grandeur in a small square of colors.  But that is what you have done here, Christophe.  Congrats on your ribbon.  It would be annoying that you''re always winning, except that you put so much effort into everything you do, that instead, it''s an inspiration.', '2011-06-20 16:43:06.000000', NULL, 0),
