(6448623, 956122, 40394, '<td valign="top">The background was actually created by a creative aperture with the Lensbaby, so that was done in camera.  The only editing was curves for contrast, a little brightening and such etc.  All editing was done in Lightroom for this image.  I love how this particular aperture does create what looks like overlays done in Photoshop.  It does, however, have a very shallow depth of field when used with a close-up filter.  <br/> <br/>Thank you everyone for comments and critiques.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-06-20 15:53:30.</i></td>', 'The background was actually created by a creative aperture with the Lensbaby, so that was done in camera.  The only editing was curves for contrast, a little brightening and such etc.  All editing was done in Lightroom for this image.  I love how this particular aperture does create what looks like overlays done in Photoshop.  It does, however, have a very shallow depth of field when used with a close-up filter.   Thank you everyone for comments and critiques.', '2011-06-20 16:52:31.000000', '2011-06-20 16:53:30.000000', 0),
