(6489564, 956648, 30982, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on the Posthumous blue ribbon - those are hard to come by and quite coveted!  And what a gorgeous pigeon.  I''m quite fond of these guys.  If this is the type of pigeon I think it is, I should point out to my American brethren that it is about the size of a US-style football.  These guys can get pretty big!</td>', 'Huge congrats on the Posthumous blue ribbon - those are hard to come by and quite coveted!  And what a gorgeous pigeon.  I''m quite fond of these guys.  If this is the type of pigeon I think it is, I should point out to my American brethren that it is about the size of a US-style football.  These guys can get pretty big!', '2011-08-02 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6493602, 956705, 74559, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image! Those pink inner ears slay me :-) Gorgeous animal.</td>', 'What a beautiful image! Those pink inner ears slay me :-) Gorgeous animal.', '2011-08-04 23:31:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6499350, 956585, 52115, '<td valign="top">This looks almost like a root. Either way it''s pointing magnificently toward its'' life sustaining energy source sunlight. Good to include its'' huge "knuckles" and "feet".<br/>I love trees, too. And other things. My surname name translated from Hungarian means "From the edge of the forest". "Erdo" = forest and "végi" = from the edge of. One of my early shootings was a 200 year old oak tree. Like the name, since I was born in April.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-09 13:32:31.</i></td>', 'This looks almost like a root. Either way it''s pointing magnificently toward its'' life sustaining energy source sunlight. Good to include its'' huge "knuckles" and "feet".I love trees, too. And other things. My surname name translated from Hungarian means "From the edge of the forest". "Erdo" = forest and "végi" = from the edge of. One of my early shootings was a 200 year old oak tree. Like the name, since I was born in April.', '2011-08-09 14:28:22.000000', '2011-08-09 14:32:31.000000', 0),
(6620817, 956754, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color coordination - one would almost think it B&amp;W except for the pink tinge of the ears and nose!</td>', 'Wonderful color coordination - one would almost think it B&W except for the pink tinge of the ears and nose!', '2011-12-18 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6620838, 956754, 61084, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Wonderful color coordination - one would almost think it B&amp;W except for the pink tinge of the ears and nose! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Exactly the look and effect I was going for. I wanted something different for the calendar challenge and the first thing that popped into my mind were those black and white period looking shots with a touch of muted color. So I really didn''t want the lose the cute pink nose, and the ears balanced it out a little. I was very happy with the results and very glad to know that you like it as well. :)<br/> <br/>Dave</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Wonderful color coordination - one would almost think it B&W except for the pink tinge of the ears and nose!   Exactly the look and effect I was going for. I wanted something different for the calendar challenge and the first thing that popped into my mind were those black and white period looking shots with a touch of muted color. So I really didn''t want the lose the cute pink nose, and the ears balanced it out a little. I was very happy with the results and very glad to know that you like it as well. :) Dave', '2011-12-18 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6736865, 956585, 137320, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure this is the location shot by another great photographer by the name of Peter Lik!</td>', 'Pretty sure this is the location shot by another great photographer by the name of Peter Lik!', '2012-04-09 04:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6784039, 956585, 43463, '<td valign="top">Yes, it has taken this long for me to come back to comment on this piece. It resonated strongly with me before while in the voting stage and the imagery of this great and majestic tree has stayed with me than I can no longer resist the call to come back and tell you how beautiful it is and finally fav it (one of two of your works. And yes, I am very picky with what I fav too if you couldn''t tell:-) ) I will admit I did have a slight envy that you were able to stand before this tree and experience it''s majestic beauty (but that has passed). The beauty of this place and the tree just wraps around you to envelop one with the quiet calm of forest serenity and mysticism - this is a place either physically or just visually where one can come to seek tranquillity when life gets hectic.</td>', 'Yes, it has taken this long for me to come back to comment on this piece. It resonated strongly with me before while in the voting stage and the imagery of this great and majestic tree has stayed with me than I can no longer resist the call to come back and tell you how beautiful it is and finally fav it (one of two of your works. And yes, I am very picky with what I fav too if you couldn''t tell:-) ) I will admit I did have a slight envy that you were able to stand before this tree and experience it''s majestic beauty (but that has passed). The beauty of this place and the tree just wraps around you to envelop one with the quiet calm of forest serenity and mysticism - this is a place either physically or just visually where one can come to seek tranquillity when life gets hectic.', '2012-06-02 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
